<section id="about" class="w-5/6 mx-auto m-6">
  <div class="gap-8 py-8 px-4 mx-auto">
    <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0">
      <h2
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
        class="mb-4 text-4xl tracking-tight font-extrabold text-primary text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d7d7d7] to-[#616161] sm:text-3xl md:text-5xl pb-2 text-center"
      >
        Get to know me!
      </h2>
      <p
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
        class="mb-6 font-light text-gray-500 md:text-lg text-justify dark:text-gray-400 sm:text-center sm:w-5/6 w-full mx-auto"
      >
        I&apos;m a <b class="font-bold">FullStack Developer</b>{" "}
        with a strong focus on Back-End systems. I specialize in creating immersive,
        engaging games while ensuring smooth, scalable, and reliable server-side architecture.
        From software mechanics to server management, I bring both the creative and
        technical sides together to build software.{" "}
        <!-- <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohitk06/"
          class="text-gray-400 font-medium"
        >
          Linkedin</a
        >{" "}
         where I post useful content related to Web Development and Programming -->
        <br />
        <br />
        Check out some of my projects where I have combined the best of <b
          class="font-bold"
        >
          Game Development</b
        > and <b class="font-bold">Software Development</b> expertise. I also love
        sharing insights on game development and backend technologies with the dev
        community, so feel free to connect with me on LinkedIn.
      </p>
